  ends in one order, unlinking every type between two memories or one, and a memory's neighbours one step away with
  their type, provenance, date and a short preview, after Second Brain's MCP server and graph (src/mcp/server.ts,
  src/graph/edges.ts, src/graph/traverse.ts); the author lock on a link's source end and on its removal, the refusal of
  a held memory and of supersedes (supersede's own), a suggestion dismissed rather than deleted, and the map and
